				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>WELL, I WANT TO THANK YOU VERY MUCH, MISTER KOSOVA, FOR TAKING THE TIME TO ALLOW US TO COME INTO YOUR HOME AND TO GIVE US YOUR TESTIMONY</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
